rika-learn
==========

rika-learn is a modified version of LearnHarness.

  Upstream:  LearnHarness, https://github.com/amosblomqvist/learnharness
  Base:      v0.3.8, commit 3dc88472eea41eed0d5e5f29c2f16f8d063c415b
